description: Runtime source for actor hosting, grants, and ephemeral tool execution
includes:
  - crates/sigil-runtime/src/
excludes:
  - crates/sigil-runtime/target/
context: |
  This scope is the implementation-level view of the runtime crate.
  It owns Wasmtime host wiring, actor lifecycle control, capability enforcement,
  runtime fuel handling, I/O grants, and ephemeral tool execution.

  Current runtime modules:
  - `runtime.rs`: Wasmtime instantiation, host imports, bootstrapping, and message dispatch
  - `actor.rs`: actor identity, lifecycle state, owned capabilities, and fuel
  - `capability.rs`: runtime capability storage, fuel inspection, and splitting
  - `message.rs`: queued message records and queue operations with stable handler ids
  - `audit.rs`: append-only runtime events
  - `supervisor.rs`: supervision strategy shape
  - `fuel.rs`: local runtime fuel accounting
  - `grants.rs`: filesystem and network grant types for ephemeral execution
  - `ephemeral.rs`: one-shot tool execution with fuel metering and FFI/import wiring

  Current runtime handoff:
  - the runtime now expects structured module imports, actor specs, and handler specs
    from `sigil-abi` instead of recovering everything from export names
  - bootstrap consumes Wasm bytes alongside shared metadata so the host boundary
    stays typed without duplicating compiler-owned artifacts
  - host imports now mutate the actor/capability/message state directly, and queue
    drain dispatches into exported Wasm handlers instead of only recording delivery
  - runtime execution decodes the currently supported bounded payload types for
    actor dispatch, while `execute_ephemeral` hosts tool modules without actor
    machinery and gates I/O through `IoGrants`
  - runtime init invocation is still bounded to the current cap-based spawn
    contract; richer bootstrap provisioning and broader value decode remain future work

  Preserve the crate boundary: compiler semantics still belong in
  `sigil-compiler`, even as this runtime grows more executable.
related:
  - crates/sigil-abi/.scope
  - crates/sigil-runtime/.scope
  - crates/sigil-compiler/.scope
tags:
  - runtime
  - src
  - host
  - toolforge
